        <mxCell id="stack" value="&lt;b&gt;Technology Stack&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;🐳 Docker   |   🐙 Docker Compose   |   ⚛️ React + Vite   |   ⚡ FastAPI   |   🟢 Nginx   |   🐘 PostgreSQL   |   🟣 Terraform   |   🔵 Ansible   |   🟧 AWS" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fontSize=16;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
